    {
      "block_id": "2605.25036_p4_b38",
      "text": "Unlike the VIT stage where language bias is nascent, DPO\nbegins with a model that has already acquired language bias\nfrom prior instruction tuning. A mild regularizer like LBR\nis insufficient for this scenario; a more potent and targeted\npenalty is needed to actively suppress this existing bias.\n",
